&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;Cause of Death: Terminated by Site Security.&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;Notes: Kevin Montgomery was an oil rig engineer off the coast of Florida for the majority of his adulthood. During his employment, his coworkers miscommunicated and dropped the sharp edge of a pipe down onto Montgomery’s hands, severing his left middle and ring fingers, and crushing his right index finger. His index finger on his right hand was amputated completely, along with two other complete amputations on his left hand to his middle and index fingers.&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
