&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-center&quot; style=&quot;width:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/cack-hub/cack_hard_poster.png&quot; style=&quot;width:100%;&quot; alt=&quot;cack_hard_poster.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:100%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitchin poster made by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wydness&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4862958&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609124839&quot; alt=&quot;Wydness&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4862958)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wydness&quot;  &gt;Wydness&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;color: white&quot;&gt;looking for pattern screamers, are we? Fuck off, pal.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;Border:solid 1px #000000; padding:7px; margin-bottom: 10px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;What&#039;s this?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The cack hard cinematic universe is home to a bunch of dumb stupid stuff, mostly weird crack fiction. Cack fiction, if you will. This is a world where things always take a turn for the stupid, farcical, and idiotic. This isn&#039;t a canon, but simply a hub to host crackfiction too stupid for LolFoundation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hidden in this collapsible are the general &#039;rules&#039; which we adhere to when writing within the cack hard cinematic universe. If for whatever reason you want to write crack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;show&amp;nbsp;block&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;–&amp;nbsp;hide&amp;nbsp;block&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No one is good at their job unless the plot demands it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Researcher Zyn Kiryu is the only person who is good at her job regardless of the situation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If anyone has to suffer, it&#039;s Mr. Fish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;049 and Spanko are best buds. No exceptions!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&#039;Cack Hard&#039; installments must be a movie of some sort. Continuity is for suckers!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bottledick is canon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Foundation is less of a jail and more of a hotel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bottledick is not canon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SCP-055 is a sphere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dr. Cimmerian sent 650 million emails and crashed scipnet servers for a week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Site-19 has an on-site burger king.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WWS is engaged in a bloody war with the Shark Punching Center.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dr. Hamm and SCP-049 are 049-J&#039;s fathers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fuck you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you write in the cack hard cinematic universe, just set this page as your content&#039;s parent page.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mixing canons and doing things that don&#039;t make any logical sense is not only allowed but encouraged.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;have fun, damn it. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;this is not a canon&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, more like a loose continuity of crack fiction that is all about writing the stupidest crap you can think of.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;Border:solid 1px #000000; padding:7px; margin-bottom: 10px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;crack fic? More like cack fic!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Home to shameful crack fiction which truly, bluely should not have seen the light of day!&lt;br /&gt;
Includes such bar-lowering classics as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;
