				<title>SCP-5127</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5127</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-5127/SCP-5127.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;SCP-5127.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5127&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5127&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Keter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; Personnel with appropriate clearance are able to be informed of SCP-5127. Should there be any signs of SCP-5127 approaching planet Earth, O5 Council are to be informed about it immediately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5127 is a planet roughly six (6) times bigger than planet Jupiter. SCP-5127&#039;s shape is complementary to an oblate spheroid. It appears to look identical to planet Earth. It is believed that one (1) Earth year on SCP-5127 is equal to ten (10) Earth years on Earth. Due to this, SCP-5127&#039;s spin speed is roughly 4471&amp;#160;m/s.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5127 does appear to have O&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-853790-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;. However, SCP-5127 does not appear to be habitable. Should any external object&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-853790-2&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; be on SCP-5127, the object will dissolve into SCP-5127 and increase its mass. This confirms SCP-5127&#039;s sentient properties. SCP-5127 has also been the cause of the destruction of planets such as [DATA EXPUNGED]. Some researchers suggest that SCP-5127 was the cause of the destruction of planet Phaeton&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-853790-3&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum 5127.1:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5127 has two (2) moons orbiting it: SCP-5127-1 and SCP-5127-2. These moons do not have any abnormalities compared to the moon known as “Luna”. SCP-5127 orbits around a sun that is called SCP-5127-3. SCP-5127-3 has twenty (20) x-class solar flares in one (1) Earth year. Should one occur, it will hit SCP-5127. However, SCP-5127-3&#039;s solar flare that hits SCP-5127 makes it larger depending on the size of the flare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum 5127.2:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5127 was discovered by NASA&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-853790-4&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; at ██-██-20██. It was discovered that SCP-5127 was moving towards planet Earth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-853790-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Oxygen.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-853790-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. An object that did not originate from SCP-5127, SCP-5127-1, SCP-5127-2 and/or SCP-5127-3.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-853790-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. However, Phaeton is a hypothetical planet and Dr. ███████ suggested that Phaeton was destroyed due to centrifugal forces.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-853790-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. National Aeronautics and Space Administration&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footer-wikiwalk-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#171; &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5126&quot;&gt;SCP-5126&lt;/a&gt; | SCP-5127 | &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5128&quot;&gt;SCP-5128&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#187;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gamerboyali&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6944105&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609124846&quot; alt=&quot;GamerboyAli&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6944105)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gamerboyali&quot;  &gt;GamerboyAli&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
